---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | NoMore5Mins"
  description="Terms of Service for NoMore5Mins. Read the terms and conditions for using our free online time tools."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-slate-50 sm:text-5xl">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 dark-muted">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400 dark-muted">

      <section>
        <p>
          Welcome to NoMore5Mins. By accessing or using our website and tools, you agree to be
          bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use
          our services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          By using NoMore5Mins (the "Service"), you agree to comply with and be bound by these
          Terms of Service. These terms apply to all visitors, users, and others who access or
          use the Service. We reserve the right to update or modify these terms at any time without
          prior notice. Your continued use of the Service after any changes constitutes acceptance
          of the new terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          NoMore5Mins provides free, browser-based time management tools including but not limited to:
          alarm clocks, timers, stopwatches, Pomodoro timers, world clocks, and clock displays.
          These tools run entirely within your web browser and do not require account registration
          or software downloads.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">3. Use of the Service</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">You agree to use the Service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these terms. You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Use the Service in any way that violates any applicable law or regulation</li>
          <li>Attempt to interfere with, compromise the system integrity or security, or decipher any transmissions to or from the servers running the Service</li>
          <li>Use any automated system, including bots, crawlers, or scrapers, to access the Service in a manner that sends more request messages to our servers than a human can reasonably produce in the same period of time</li>
          <li>Reproduce, duplicate, copy, sell, resell, or exploit any portion of the Service without express written permission</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">4. Alarm and Timer Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <strong class="text-slate-50 dark-text">Important:</strong> The reliability of alarm and timer
          functions provided by NoMore5Mins depends on several factors outside of our control, including
          but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Your browser's ability to play audio and display notifications</li>
          <li>Your device's power state (screen on/off, sleep mode, battery saver)</li>
          <li>Browser tab activity (background tabs may be throttled by the browser)</li>
          <li>Your device's volume settings and audio output configuration</li>
          <li>Operating system notification permissions and settings</li>
          <li>Internet connectivity during use</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <strong class="text-amber-500">NoMore5Mins should not be used as the sole alarm for
          safety-critical or time-critical situations.</strong> We strongly recommend using a dedicated
          hardware alarm clock or your phone's built-in alarm as a backup for important wake-up times,
          medication reminders, or other critical events.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          The Service and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by NoMore5Mins
          and are protected by international copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.
          The NoMore5Mins name, logo, and all related names, logos, product and service names, designs,
          and slogans are trademarks of NoMore5Mins.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          The Service is provided on an <strong class="text-slate-50 dark-text">"as is"</strong> and
          <strong class="text-slate-50 dark-text">"as available"</strong> basis, without any warranties
          of any kind, either express or implied. NoMore5Mins does not warrant that:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>The Service will function uninterrupted, securely, or be available at any particular time or location</li>
          <li>Any errors or defects will be corrected</li>
          <li>The Service is free of viruses or other harmful components</li>
          <li>The results of using the Service will meet your requirements</li>
          <li>Alarms or timers will trigger accurately or reliably in all circumstances</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          In no event shall NoMore5Mins, its operators, affiliates, or contributors be liable for any
          indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including without limitation,
          loss of profits, data, use, goodwill, or other intangible losses, resulting from:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Your use or inability to use the Service</li>
          <li>Any failure of alarms, timers, or other time-based functions to trigger as expected</li>
          <li>Any unauthorized access to or use of data stored locally on your device</li>
          <li>Any interruption or cessation of transmission to or from the Service</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">8. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Our Service may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not owned or
          controlled by NoMore5Mins. We have no control over, and assume no responsibility for, the
          content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites or services. We use
          third-party services including Google Analytics and Google AdSense, which are governed by
          their own terms and privacy policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms of Service at any time. If a revision
          is material, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. What constitutes
          a material change will be determined at our sole discretion. By continuing to access or use
          our Service after those revisions become effective, you agree to be bound by the revised terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with applicable laws, without
          regard to conflict of law provisions. Our failure to enforce any right or provision of
          these Terms will not be considered a waiver of those rights.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">11. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@nomore5mins.com" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">hello@nomore5mins.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
